\frametitle{Move from process transport to true multi-machine federation}
message-fault controls. It is not physical multi-host evidence. That
later claim requires receipts from distinct hosts, deployment-grade key
management, timeout policy, and long-running orchestration across
process restarts, but it does not require changing the mathematics.
Secure aggregation, differential privacy, and Byzantine tolerance are
separate future threat models; transport integrity alone would not
establish any of them (Blanchard et al. 2017; Pillutla et al. 2022).
